hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1277","[AI-translation] Urwah ke walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Pehle mard jab apni biwi ko talaq deta phir us ki iddat khatm hone se pahle us se ruju' kar leta to yeh us ka haq tha, agarche woh use hazaar martaba talaq de. Phir ek aadmi apni aurat ki taraf mutawajjeh hua to use talaq di, phir use mohlat di yahan tak ke jab us ki iddat khatm hone wali hoti to us se ruju' kar leta phir use talaq de deta, aur kahta: Allah ki qasam na main tumhen apne paas basaunga aur na tum kabhi halal hogi. To Allah Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Talaq do martaba hai, phir ya to dastoor ke mutabiq rokna hai ya achche tareeq se chhor dena hai [Baqarah: 229]. To logon ne us din se talaq ka naya aaghaz kiya, un mein se jis ne talaq di thi ya nahin di thi."
"1278","[AI-translation] Urwah ke walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Pehle mard jab apni biwi ko talaq deta phir us ki iddat khatm hone se pahle us se ruju' kar leta to yeh us ka haq tha, agarche woh use hazaar martaba talaq de. Phir ek aadmi apni biwi ki taraf mutawajjeh hua to use talaq di, yahan tak ke jab us ki iddat khatm hone wali hoti to us se ruju' kar leta, phir use talaq de deta, phir kahta: Allah ki qasam na main tumhen apne paas basaunga aur na tum kabhi halal hogi. To Allah Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Talaq do martaba hai, phir ya to dastoor ke mutabiq rokna hai ya achche tareeq se chhor dena hai [Baqarah: 229]. To logon ne talaq ka naya aaghaz kiya, un mein se jis ne talaq di thi aur jis ne nahin di thi."
"1279","[AI-translation] Nafi' bin Ujair bin Abd Yazid se riwayat hai ke Rukanah bin Abd Yazid ne apni biwi ko talaq di, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Main ne apni biwi ko talaq batta de di hai, aur Allah ki qasam mera ek hi ka irada tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam! Kya tera ek hi ka irada tha?' To Rukanah ne kaha: Mera ek hi ka irada tha. To Aap ne use us ke paas wapas bhej diya."
"1280","[AI-translation] Nafi' bin Ujair bin Abd Yazid se riwayat hai ke Rukanah bin Abd Yazid ne apni biwi Suhaimah Muzaniyah ko talaq batta de di, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne apni biwi Suhaimah ko talaq batta de di hai, aur Allah ki qasam mera ek hi ka irada tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Rukanah se farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam! Kya tera ek hi ka irada tha?' To Rukanah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Mera ek hi ka irada tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use Rukanah ke paas lauta diya. Phir us ne use doosri talaq Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein di aur teesri talaq Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein di."
"1281","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abbad bin Ja'far se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Muttalib bin Hantab ne khabar di ke us ne apni biwi ko talaq batta di, phir woh Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr un se kiya. To unhon ne farmaya: Tumhen is par kis ne ubhara? Us ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main kar chuka. To unhon ne padha: Aur agar woh wahi karen jis ki unhen naseehat ki jati hai to yaqeenan yeh un ke liye behtar aur zyada mazbooti wala ho [Nisa: 66]. Tumhen is par kis ne ubhara? Us ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main kar chuka. To unhon ne farmaya: Apni aurat ko apne paas rok lo, kyunke ek hi qata' karti hai."
"1282","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Tau'amah se wahi kaha jo unhon ne Muttalib se kaha tha."
"1283","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko talaq de to woh us se ruju' ka zyada haqdar hai, yahan tak ke woh teesre haiz se ghusl kare, ek aur do mein."
"1284","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh Hafsa ke makan mein thin, aur un ka masjid ka rasta tha, to woh gharon ke peeche se doosra rasta ikhtiyar karte ke un se ijazat lene ko napasand karte, yahan tak ke unhon ne us se ruju' kar liya."
"1285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se us aadmi ke bare mein riwayat hai jo apni biwi ko talaq de phir us se ruju' par gawah banae jabke us ki biwi ko is ka ilm na ho, unhon ne farmaya: Woh pahle ki biwi hai, doosre ne us se suhbat ki ho ya na ki ho."
"1286","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar farmate the ke jab aadmi apni biwi ko ikhtiyar de de to faisla wahi hai jo aurat kare siwae is ke ke mard is ka inkar kare aur kahe: Main ne ek talaq ka irada kiya tha aur woh is baat par qasam bhi uthae, aur woh jab tak aurat iddat mein hai us ka zyada haqdar hai."
"1287","[AI-translation] Kharijah bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhen khabar di ke woh Zaid bin Sabit ke paas baithe hue the ke un ke paas Muhammad bin Abi Atiq rote hue aae. Zaid bin Sabit ne un se poocha: Tumhen kya hua? Us ne kaha: Main ne apni aurat ko us ke mamle ka ikhtiyar diya to us ne mujh se judai kar li. To Zaid ne un se poocha: Tumhen is par kis ne ubhara? To us ne un se kaha: Taqdeer. To Zaid ne un se kaha: Ruju' kar lo agar tum chaho, kyunke yeh ek hi hai, aur tum us ke zyada haqdar ho."
